---
description: Prepare one constructMenu evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: DishConcept[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Assemble a balanced menu whose dishes work together across preparation effort, equipment, pacing, and customer choice. Identify shared components and bottlenecks, preserve meaningful alternatives for required diets, and avoid creating variety only through superficial garnish changes. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
